    <briefdescription>
<para>OpenGL Vertex Array Object (VAO) wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A VAO stores the vertex attribute configuration for a vertex buffer. It encapsulates the state of vertex attributes (position, texture coordinates, etc.).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The VAO must be bound before configuring vertex attributes. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classVertexBuffer" kindref="compound">VertexBuffer</ref>, <ref refid="classIndexBuffer" kindref="compound">IndexBuffer</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
